{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 121,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.16120147705078,
        527.0029296875,
        82.30619812011719
      ],
      "text": "for sensitivity was more than 10 percentage points worse than the best performing platform,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        84.66120147705078,
        486.8130187988281,
        97.80619812011719
      ],
      "text": "or where the point estimate for specificity was more than 5 percentage points worse.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        108.66522979736328,
        527.0029296875,
        121.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "An IPD meta-analysis was performed instead of a classical meta-analysis, because the studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        124.16522979736328,
        526.9656372070312,
        137.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "identified in the literature were generally too small to contribute to a classical meta-analysis,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.66522216796875,
        526.9371337890625,
        152.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "particularly for the new and repurposed drugs. In addition, this type of approach allowed for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.16522216796875,
        527.0029296875,
        168.3102264404297
      ],
      "text": "relevant co-variables to be included in the model; it could also control for repeated testing on",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.66522216796875,
        524.422607421875,
        183.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "the same samples using different platforms, which was the case for much of the available data.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.98098373413086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.66912841796875,
        527.2935791015625,
        207.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "For each dependent variable, a multivariable model included a number of co-variables as fixed",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989094734191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.14956665039062,
        524.4093627929688,
        223.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "® ® effects. These included rifampicin resistance as determined by Xpert MTB/RIF  or Xpert Ultra",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.66912841796875,
        523.961669921875,
        238.8141326904297
      ],
      "text": "for all drugs other than rifampicin; semiquantitative cycle threshold (CT) value from Xpert MTB/",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.964191436767578,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        241.14956665039062,
        526.7127075195312,
        254.3141326904297
      ],
      "text": "® ® RIF  or Xpert Ultra ; and a co-variable to indicate which samples featured in duplicate, meaning",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978629112243652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.66912841796875,
        527.0591430664062,
        269.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "that some samples were sequenced on two different platforms and thus were represented",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.16912841796875,
        526.9634399414062,
        285.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "twice in the analysis. For models looking specifically at diagnostic test accuracy in PLHIV, the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.66912841796875,
        527.0250244140625,
        300.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "HIV test result was included as a co-variable. Finally, the study site was included as a random",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        303.16912841796875,
        527.1736450195312,
        316.31414794921875
      ],
      "text": "effect. The models were run in Stata (version 17) using the melogit command, and the outputs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990095138549805,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.66912841796875,
        526.9701538085938,
        331.81414794921875
      ],
      "text": "were transformed using the margins command. Models were run for all PICO questions for",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        334.1690979003906,
        193.23980712890625,
        347.3141174316406
      ],
      "text": "sensitivity and specificity.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.1730041503906,
        527.01953125,
        371.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "The certainty of the evidence of the pooled studies was assessed systematically for each of the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.99940013885498,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        373.6730041503906,
        526.9371948242188,
        386.8180236816406
      ],
      "text": "PICO questions using the GRADE approach, which produces an overall quality assessment (or",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.1730041503906,
        518.63671875,
        402.3180236816406
      ],
      "text": "certainty) of evidence and has a framework for translating evidence into recommendations.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        413.1769104003906,
        526.9589233398438,
        426.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "The GRADEpro Guideline Development Tool software   was used to generate summary of  (16)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.6769104003906,
        526.9822998046875,
        441.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "findings tables for the sensitivity and specificity of each drug. The numbers of samples classified",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.968254089355469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        444.1769104003906,
        526.9810180664062,
        457.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "as true, false positive or negative were then calculated across a range of three prevalences of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        459.6769104003906,
        527.0901489257812,
        472.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "drug resistance, chosen to be representative of different global settings. The quality of evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.95947551727295,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        475.1769104003906,
        526.9808959960938,
        488.3219299316406
      ],
      "text": "was rated as high (not downgraded), moderate (downgraded one level), low (downgraded",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        490.6769104003906,
        527.1725463867188,
        503.8219299316406
      ],
      "text": "two levels) or very low (downgraded more than two levels), based on five factors: risk of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.1768798828125,
        526.9480590820312,
        519.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "bias, indirectness, inconsistency, imprecision and other considerations. The quality (certainty)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        521.6768798828125,
        526.9459838867188,
        534.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "of evidence was downgraded by one level when a serious issue was identified and by two",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        537.1768798828125,
        526.9656372070312,
        550.3218994140625
      ],
      "text": "levels when a very serious issue was identified in any of the factors used to judge the quality",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.6768798828125,
        130.0789031982422,
        565.8218994140625
      ],
      "text": "of evidence.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.680908203125,
        526.974853515625,
        589.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "The data sources for the IPD data analysis are shown in   The analysis included data  Fig. 2.4.5.1.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.995899200439453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.180908203125,
        526.6126098632812,
        605.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "from published studies, a large multicountry trial conducted by FIND, and several other studies",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987342834472656,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        607.680908203125,
        527.1406860351562,
        620.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "across multiple countries. Most of the studies only evaluated the Deeplex assay, while the FIND",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.982736587524414,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        623.180908203125,
        526.8988037109375,
        636.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "trial evaluated both the Deeplex and the AmPORE-TB. Only one study evaluated TBseq. For each",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.953401565551758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        638.680908203125,
        526.9755859375,
        651.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "drug, one or two platforms were dropped from the analysis based on the overall number of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        654.180908203125,
        526.926025390625,
        667.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "resistant or susceptible samples available for that platform and drug, or because the accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.680908203125,
        526.6414794921875,
        682.825927734375
      ],
      "text": "of the platform did not meet the diagnostic test accuracy criteria for inclusion when compared",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.987092971801758,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        685.180908203125,
        242.17788696289062,
        698.325927734375
      ],
      "text": "with the best performing platform.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        353.2680969238281,
        802.0169067382812,
        556.809326171875,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "2. Recommendations for diagnosis of TB disease 105",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}